### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083
@token = ...
### ── SIGNUP ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Signup — success (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "12345@12345.12345",
  "password": "secret123"
}

###

### 2. Signup — duplicate email (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

###

### 3. Signup — invalid email format (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "secret123"
}

###

### 4. Signup — password too short, under 8 chars (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "password": "short"
}

###

### 5. Signup — missing fields (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### ── LOGIN ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 6. Login — success, returns JWT (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "12345@12345.12345",
  "password": "secret123"
}

###

### 7. Login — wrong password (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### 8. Login — unknown email (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

###

### ── JWKS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 9. JWKS — fetch public RSA key (200, no auth required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/.well-known/jwks.json

###

### ── PROTECTED (smoke test) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 10. Protected endpoint without token — expect 401/403
GET {{baseUrl}}/protected-smoke-test

###

### 11. Protected endpoint with valid Bearer token — expect 404 (endpoint exists, auth passes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/protected-smoke-test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
